			"Message": "docs(Grove): Format technical terms in backticks for consistency\n\nApply Markdown backticks to technical terms throughout the README.md to ensure visual distinction and consistency with project documentation standards. Update references for `Rust`, `WASM`, `VS Code`, `Node.js`, `WASMtime`, `gRPC`, `IPC`, and related API surface terms.\n\nThis formatting change improves readability and aligns the Grove documentation style with the rest of the CodeEditorLand ecosystem, ensuring that all technical terminology is clearly demarcated.",
			"SHA": "0d71bba63165e8027edfab4e8eb315c4a976fc5f"
		},
